          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Musa yaagambira Arooni n'abatabani ati: Muteekye egyo nyama aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, mube niho mwagiriira hamwe n'emigaati eri omu kiibo ey'okushoroorwa kw'abanyamurwa, nk'oku naaragiire, ningira nti: Arooni n'abatabani bagirye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyama n'emigaati ebiraatsigareho, mubyotsye n'omuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumare ebiro mushanju, mutarikushohora aheeru y'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, okuhitsya ahu ebiro by'okushoroorwa kwanyu birihwera; ahabw'okuba okushoroorwa kwanyu nikwija kumara ebiro mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'oku byakorwa eri izooba, nikwo MUKAMA yaaragiira ku biguma nibikorwa bityo okubarihiirira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
